      "name": "Invoice Document",
      "description": {
        "content": "An **Invoice Document** is a file attached to an **Invoice**, such as the invoice PDF or supporting evidence. At least one document is required before an invoice can be checked; documents can be uploaded, downloaded and, under certain conditions, deleted.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
